{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14057","headline":"岐阳客舍呈张明府 · 耿湋","name":"岐阳客舍呈张明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逸妻稚子应沟壑，归路茫茫东去遥。\n凉叶下时心悄悄，空斋梦里雨萧萧。\n星霜渐见侵华发，生长虚闻在圣朝。\n知己只今何处在，故山无事别渔樵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}